                        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
                            <h2 id="tenax-proseal-professional-grade" class="scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black text-white mt-0 mb-4 border-none">Tenax Proseal (Professional Grade)</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 border-none">
                                If you ask a high-end stone fabricator what they use in their shop on $10,000 Calacatta slabs, the answer is usually Tenax Proseal. It is a premium, solvent-based permeating impregnator that offers maximum defense against both water-based and severe oil-based stains (like hot bacon grease or olive oil).
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 border-none text-sm">
                                Proseal utilizes advanced solvent chemistry to force its protective polymers incredibly deep into the stone, rather than hovering near the surface. It does not alter the stone's color, allows the marble to fully breathe (preventing efflorescence), and is suitable for high-traffic floors and daily-use kitchen countertops alike.
                            </p>
                            <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2 mb-6 list-none p-0 text-sm">
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[#38BDF8] font-bold">✓</span> Professional fabricator standard</li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[#38BDF8] font-bold">✓</span> Extreme oil and water repellency</li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[#38BDF8] font-bold">✓</span> Penetrates dense, polished marble</li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-[#38BDF8] font-bold">✓</span> Lasts 3-5 years per application</li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 font-bold">✗</span> Strong solvent odor during application</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2 id="the-complete-product-reviews" class="scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6 font-sans">
                    The Complete Product Reviews
                </h2>

                <div class="space-y-12">
                    <!-- Review 2 -->
                    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow bg-white">
                        <div class="inline-block bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">Best Premium / Longest Lasting</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Dry-Treat Stain-Proof Plus</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
                            Stain-Proof Plus (formerly known as Stain-Proof Original) by Dry-Treat is arguably the most advanced penetrating sealer on the market. Dry-Treat engineered a bespoke fluoropolymer molecule that is hundreds of times smaller than competing sealer molecules. This allows it to penetrate deeper than anything else, permanently bonding to the capillary walls within the stone.
